  "details": "There have been tons of avatar assets over the years that facilitate some kind of short range teleport/portal. But this only works for everyone else except for the avatar the asset is installed on. \n\nI understand this was done to prevent the avatar from wildly glitching out but with the ability to world-anchor vrcstations, this shouldnt cause much of a problem. \n\nAnd with the recent release of the \"strange portal\" by liindy alot of us want to be able to use our own portals even more now. \n\nPlease update the SDK to make self interact vrcstations a toggleable option in the SDK that way we can control when a station should be self interact or not and avoid the glitching that was originally trying to be avoided without hindering our ability to use it to make functional features.\n\nAsset in question:\n\nhttps://liindy.gumroad.com/l/StrangePortal?layout=profile&recommended_by=library",
